cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BMM-4D, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "BMM-4D: bird-migration reconstruction in space and time from weather radars"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB package to reconstruct animated 3D bird-density fields from a
  network of weather radars (NEXRAD): radar cleaning, forward model,
  density prior, advection-regularized inversion and maps.
version: 0.1.0
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/birdmigrationmap/BMM-4D"
keywords:
  - bird migration
  - weather radar
  - NEXRAD
  - aeroecology
  - inverse problem
authors:
  - family-names: Nussbaumer
    given-names: Raphaël
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-8185-1020"
    affiliation: Swiss Ornithological Institute
  - family-names: Dokter
    given-names: Adriaan
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6573-066X"
    affiliation: Cornell University
